data: {"query":"他有哪些论文","query_type":"canonical_v2:A:answer","answer_text":"“他”指向的是这篇论文的作者之一 Yong Yao。从公开信息看，Yong Yao 参与发表的论文至少有：\n\n- 《Ultra-high sensitivity Fabry–Perot interferometer gas refractive index fiber sensor based on photonic crystal fiber and Vernier effect》，2015 年发表于 Optics Letters，作者包括 Mingran Quan、Jiajun Tian、Yong Yao。该工作提出一种基于光子晶体光纤与 Vernier 效应的开放式法布里–珀罗干涉仪气体折射率传感器，实验测得折射率灵敏度达 30899 nm/RIU。\n- 《Reversal of optical binding force by Fano resonance in plasmonic nanorod heterodimer》，2013 年发表于 Optics Express，作者包括 Q. Zhang、Jun‐Jun Xiao、X. M. Zhang、Yong Yao、Hui Liu。研究金纳米棒异二聚体在偶极–四极 Fano 共振附近光结合力的反转现象。\n- 《An Ultra-Compact 3-dB Power Splitter for Three Modes Based on Pixelated Meta-Structure》，2020 年发表于 IEEE Photonics Technology Letters，作者包括 Hucheng Xie、Yingjie Liu、Yuhan Wang、Yujie Wang、Yong Yao、Qinghai Song。报道一种基于像素化超结构的超紧凑三模 3-dB 功率分束器，尺寸仅 4 × 4.5 μm²。\n- 《High-speed silicon photonic Mach–Zehnder modulator at 2 μm》，2021 年发表于 Photonics Research，作者包括 Xi Wang、Weihong Shen、Wenxiang Li、Yingjie Liu、Yong Yao、Jiangbing Du。展示面向 2 μm 波段的高速硅基马赫–曾德尔调制器，采用 PAM-4 格式时调制速率可达 80 Gbit/s。\n\n以上是目前可确认的、Yong Yao 作为作者参与的论文。如果您想进一步了解其中某篇的具体内容或他在某一方向的成果，我可以再帮您梳理。","citations":[{"type":"paper","id":"official-source-23703260af8b9901","label":"Ultra-high sensitivity Fabry–Perot interferometer gas refractive index fiber sensor based on photonic crystal fiber and Vernier effect","url":"https://doi.org/10.1364/ol.40.004891"},{"type":"paper","id":"official-source-c0eed461b00a962d","label":"Reversal of optical binding force by Fano resonance in plasmonic nanorod heterodimer","url":"https://doi.org/10.1364/oe.21.006601"},{"type":"paper","id":"official-source-667a8a2afcc1934c","label":"An Ultra-Compact 3-dB Power Splitter for Three Modes Based on Pixelated Meta-Structure","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/lpt.2020.2975128"},{"type":"paper","id":"official-source-39c1c3b2e0f344b1","label":"High-speed silicon photonic Mach–Zehnder modulator at 2 μm","url":"https://doi.org/10.1364/prj.417107"}],"evidence":[],"clarification":null,"structured_payload":{},"answer_style":"llm_synthesized","citation_map":{"1":"official-source-23703260af8b9901","2":"official-source-c0eed461b00a962d","3":"official-source-667a8a2afcc1934c","4":"official-source-39c1c3b2e0f344b1"},"suggested_followups":[]}

